// GKE's "Sign in with Google" (Ichor's own iOS OAuth client, see the GKE tracking issue's
// manual steps). Empty here: the option does not exist in a build without a client (CI, forks).
// To build with one, put the two values in GoogleSignIn.local.xcconfig next to this file
// (git-ignored), e.g.:
//   GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID = 123-abc.apps.googleusercontent.com
//   GOOGLE_IOS_REVERSED_CLIENT_ID = com.googleusercontent.apps.123-abc
GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID =
GOOGLE_IOS_REVERSED_CLIENT_ID =
#include? "GoogleSignIn.local.xcconfig"
